blurb = "Depicts the head of a daimyō's (feudal lord's) procession at the entrance to a village, and three peasants bowing as it passes. The most frequent users of such highways were the feudal lords with their retinues. Commoners who came across a procession had to kneel down on the ground to pay their respects and stay there until the procession had passed."
